sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant C as 🖥️ Client (Blazor WASM)
    participant S as 🌐 Server (ASP.NET Core)
    participant H as 📡 SignalR Hub
    participant L as 🖥️ Local (WebLLM)
    participant R as ☁️ Remote (Foundry)
    participant O as 🔧 Ollama Service
    participant D as 💾 Azure Table Storage

    U->>C: Selects Left + Right models + enters prompt
    C->>S: POST /api/duels { leftModelId, rightModelId, prompt }
    S->>S: CommenceDuelHandler creates Duel
    S->>D: Save Duel to Duels table
    S-->>C: 202 Accepted { duelId }
    C->>H: JoinDuel(duelId)
    H-->>C: Joined group duel:{duelId}
    C->>C: Navigate to /processing/{duelId}

    par Concurrent Inference
        S->>S: DuelExecutionService.RunModelAsync(Left)
        S->>S: DuelExecutionService.RunModelAsync(Right)
    end

    alt Left = Local
        S->>H: SendStartLocalInference { duelId, modelId, webLlmModelId }
        H->>C: ModelStatusUpdate { status: "Initializing" }
        C->>L: Start WebLLM worker (WebGPU)
        L-->>C: Worker ready
        loop Token Generation
            L-->>C: TokenStream { tokenCount, htmlPreview }
            C->>H: ReceiveStatusUpdate
            H->>C: ModelStatusUpdate (broadcast)
        end
        L-->>C: InferenceComplete { html, tokenCount, duration }
        C->>S: POST /api/duels/{id}/local-result { modelId, html, tokenCount }
        S->>D: Save DuelResult
    else Left = Remote
        S->>R: POST /chat/completions { prompt }
        loop Stream Response
            R-->>S: SSE Token { content }
            S->>H: SendModelStatusUpdate { tokenCount, elapsed }
            H->>C: ModelStatusUpdate (broadcast)
        end
        R-->>S: Complete { fullHtml }
        S->>D: Save DuelResult
    else Left = LocalService
        S->>O: POST /api/generate { model, prompt }
        loop Stream Response
            O-->>S: SSE Token { content }
            S->>H: SendModelStatusUpdate { tokenCount, elapsed }
            H->>C: ModelStatusUpdate (broadcast)
        end
        O-->>S: Complete { fullHtml }
        S->>D: Save DuelResult
    end

    par Right Side (same pattern as Left)
        Note over S,H,C,R,O: Right side follows identical inference path
    end

    S->>H: SendDuelComplete { duelId, results }
    H->>C: DuelComplete (broadcast)
    C->>C: Navigate to /arena/{duelId}

    U->>C: Reviews both HTML outputs (sandboxed)
    U->>C: Clicks "Left Wins" or "Right Wins"
    C->>S: POST /api/duels/{id}/verdict { verdict: "Left" | "Right" }
    S->>S: RecordVerdictHandler processes

    alt Human Verdict
        S->>S: Load Winner + Loser Models
        S->>S: EloCalculator.Calculate(winnerElo, loserElo, K=32, outcome=1.0)
        S->>D: Update Model.CurrentElo, DuelCount, WinCount
        S->>D: Append EloRecord (for sparkline)
    else Auto-Judge
        S->>R: POST /chat/completions { prompt: judgePrompt }
        R-->>S: Judgment { winner: "Left" | "Right" }
        S->>S: EloCalculator.Calculate (same as above)
    end

    S-->>C: VerdictResponseDto { new Elo, shift }
    C->>C: Update Leaderboard display
    U->>C: View updated rankings